0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Burst duration, Voice Onset Time \(VOT\), and vowel fundamental frequency) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(\(F0\) perturbation were quantified. Aspirated root onsets showed mean) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
